  "prefLabel": "Pes 101.07 Common chemical name",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 101.07 \"Common chemical name\" means a well-known, simple name of a pesticide accepted by the pesticide regulation division of the Environmental Protection Agency or those adopted by the American National Standards Institute (ANSI).\n\nSource. #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss and moved by #6239, eff 5-2-96 (from Pes 101.06)",
